-height:36pt;width:100%"><div><span><br/></span></div></div><div style="-sec-extract:summary"><table style="border-collapse:collapse;display:inline-table;margin-bottom:5pt;vertical-align:text-bottom;width:100.000%"><tr><td style="width:1.0%"/><td style="width:8.980%"/><td style="width:0.1%"/><td style="width:1.0%"/><td style="width:88.820%"/><td style="width:0.1%"/></tr><tr><td colspan="3" style="padding:2px 1pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:top"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:700;line-height:100%">Item&#160;5.07</span></td><td colspan="3" style="padding:2px 1pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:top"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:700;line-height:100%">Submission of Matters to a Vote of Security Holders.</span></td></tr></table></div><div><span><br/></span></div><div><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:112%">Rent the Runway, Inc. (the &#8220;Company&#8221;) held a Special Meeting of Stockholders on March&#160;21, 2024 (the &#8220;Special Meeting&#8221;). A total of shares of 51,954,468 Class A common stock and 3,098,580 Class B common stock (collectively, the &#8220;Common Stock&#8221;), representing 113,926,068 votes, were present in person or represented by proxy at the meeting, representing approximately 87.8% of the combined voting power of the Company&#8217;s outstanding Common Stock as of the January 29, 2024 record date. The following are the voting results for the proposals considered and voted upon at the meeting, each of which were described in the Company&#8217;s Definitive Proxy Statement filed with the Securities and Exchange Commission on February 9, 2024.</span></div><div><span><br/></span></div><div><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:112%">Item 1 - Approval of Amendments to the Company&#8217;s Twelfth Amended and Restated Certificate of Incorporation to effect a reverse stock split of the Company&#8217;s Class A common stock and Class B common stock (the &#8220;Reverse Stock Split Proposal&#8221;).</span></div><div><span><br/></span></div><div><table style="border-collapse:collapse;display:inline-table;margin-bottom:5pt;vertical-align:text-bottom;width:85.737%"><tr><td style="width:1.0%"/><td style="width:20.769%"/><td style="width:0.1%"/><td style="width:0.1%"/><td style="width:0.547%"/><td style="width:0.1%"/><td style="width:1.0%"/><td style="width:22.825%"/><td style="width:0.1%"/><td style="width:0.1%"/><td style="width:0.547%"/><td style="width:0.1%"/><td style="width:1.0%"/><td style="width:24.881%"/><td style="width:0.1%"/><td style="width:0.1%"/><td style="width:0.547%"/><td style="width:0.1%"/><td style="width:1.0%"/><td style="width:24.884%"/><td style="width:0.1%"/></tr><tr><td colspan="3" style="padding:2px 1pt;text-align:center;vertical-align:bottom"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:700;line-height:100%">Votes FOR</span></td><td colspan="3" style="padding:0 1pt"/><td colspan="3" style="padding:2px 1pt;text-align:center;vertical-align:bottom"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:700;line-height:100%">Votes AGAINST</span></td><td colspan="3" style="padding:0 1pt"/><td colspan="3" style="padding:2px 1pt;text-align:center;vertical-align:bottom"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:700;line-height:100%">Votes ABSTAINED</span></td><td colspan="3" style="padding:0 1pt"/><td colspan="3" style="padding:2px 1pt;text-align:center;vertical-align:bottom"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:700;line-height:100%">Broker Non-Votes</span></td></tr><tr><td colspan="2" style="background-color:#cceeff;border-top: